<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="es">
<head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8">
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
    <title>Aplicación de Nómina</title>
    <style>
        body { font-family: system-ui, -apple-system, sans-serif; background-color: #0f172a; color: #f8fafc; margin: 0; padding: 0; }
        
        /* Franja superior de líneas nacionales */
        .top-bar {
            background-color: #0f172a;
            color: #94a3b8;
            font-size: 0.8rem;
            padding: 8px 30px;
            border-bottom: 1px solid #1e293b;
            letter-spacing: 0.02em;
        }

        /* Barra de Navegación */
        nav { background: #1e293b; padding: 15px 30px; display: flex; justify-content: space-between; align-items: center; border-bottom: 1px solid #334155; }
        .logo { font-weight: bold; font-size: 1.25rem; color: #38bdf8; display: flex; align-items: center; gap: 8px; }
        .nav-links { display: flex; gap: 20px; align-items: center; }
        .nav-links a { color: #cbd5e1; text-decoration: none; font-weight: 500; transition: color 0.2s; }
        .nav-links a:hover { color: #38bdf8; }

        /* Estilo para el botón de Iniciar Sesión en el Nav */
        .btn-login {
            background: rgba(56, 189, 248, 0.1);
            color: #38bdf8 !important;
            border: 1px solid rgba(56, 189, 248, 0.3);
            padding: 8px 16px;
            border-radius: 20px;
            display: flex;
            align-items: center;
            gap: 6px;
            font-size: 0.9rem;
            transition: all 0.2s ease;
        }
        .btn-login:hover {
            background: #38bdf8;
            color: #0f172a !important;
        }

        /* Animaciones CSS Fluidas */
        @keyframes slideInLeft {
            from {
                opacity: 0;
                transform: translateX(-50px);
            }
            to {
                opacity: 1;
                transform: translateX(0);
            }
        }

        @keyframes slideInRight {
            from {
                opacity: 0;
                transform: translateX(50px);
            }
            to {
                opacity: 1;
                transform: translateX(0);
            }
        }

        .hero-banner-anim {
            animation: slideInLeft 1s ease-out forwards;
        }

        .hero-image-anim {
            animation: slideInRight 1s ease-out forwards;
        }

        .hero-btn-interactive {
            transition: transform 0.3s ease, box-shadow 0.3s ease;
        }

        .hero-btn-interactive:hover {
            transform: translateY(-3px);
            box-shadow: 0 10px 20px rgba(56, 189, 248, 0.4);
        }

        /* Banner Estilo Financiero / Consultoría */
        .hero-banner {
            background: #111c30;
            border-bottom: 1px solid #334155;
            padding: 60px 80px;
            display: flex;
            justify-content: space-between;
            align-items: center;
            width: 92%;
            max-width: 1600px;
            margin: 40px auto;
            border-radius: 24px;
            box-shadow: 0 25px 35px -10px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.4);
            gap: 60px;
            flex-wrap: wrap;
            overflow: hidden;
        }
        .hero-content {
            flex: 1;
            min-width: 400px;
            text-align: left;
        }
        .hero-content h1 {
            font-size: 3.4rem;
            line-height: 1.15;
            margin-bottom: 30px;
            color: #ffffff;
        }
        .hero-content h1 span {
            color: #38bdf8;
        }
        .hero-content p {
            color: #94a3b8;
            font-size: 1.3rem;
            line-height: 1.6;
            margin-bottom: 40px;
            text-align: left;
        }
        .hero-content p strong {
            color: #cbd5e1;
        }
        .hero-btn {
            background: #d97706;
            color: white;
            padding: 16px 32px;
            font-size: 1.2rem;
            border-radius: 8px;
            text-decoration: none;
            font-weight: 600;
            display: inline-block;
            transition: background 0.2s;
            box-shadow: 0 4px 6px -1px rgba(217, 119, 6, 0.3);
        }
        .hero-btn:hover {
            background: #b45309;
        }
        .hero-image-container {
            flex: 1.2;
            min-width: 450px;
            background: linear-gradient(135deg, #334155 0%, #0f172a 100%);
            height: 440px;
            border-radius: 18px;
            display: flex;
            align-items: center;
            justify-content: center;
            border: 1px solid #475569;
            box-shadow: 0 15px 25px -5px rgba(0,0,0,0.4);
            position: relative;
            overflow: hidden;
        }
        .hero-image-container span {
            color: #64748b;
            font-weight: 500;
            font-size: 0.95rem;
        }
    </style>
</head>
<body>

    <!-- Franja Superior -->
    <div class="top-bar">
        Líneas nacionales: 316 301 6937 - 300 669 6513 - 318 206 4911
    </div>

    <!-- Barra de Navegación con Inicio de Sesión -->
    <nav>
        <div class="logo">⚡ Aplicación Nómina</div>
        <div class="nav-links">
            <a href="/">Inicio</a>
            <a href="/api/departamentos">Departamentos</a>
            <a href="/nomina">Nómina Simple</a>
            <a href="/nomina-automatica">Nómina Automática</a>
            <a href="/login" class="btn-login">
                👤 Iniciar Sesión
            </a>
        </div>
    </nav>

    <!-- Banner Principal Animado: Automatización y Conciliación Expandido -->
    <div class="hero-banner">
        <div class="hero-content hero-banner-anim">
            <h1>Automatización de Nómina y <span>Conciliación Inteligente</span></h1>
            <p>Optimice la gestión financiera de su empresa con nuestro sistema avanzado. Automatice el cálculo de pagos, elimine errores operativos y logre una <strong>conciliación precisa</strong> en tiempo récord para un mayor control administrativo.</p>
            <a href="/nomina-automatica" class="hero-btn hero-btn-interactive">Comenzar Automatización</a>
        </div>
        <div class="hero-image-container hero-image-anim">
            <img src="/images/financiero.png" alt="Automatización de nómina y conciliación" style="width: 100%; height: 100%; object-fit: cover; display: block; transition: transform 0.5s ease;" onmouseover="this.style.transform='scale(1.03)'" onmouseout="this.style.transform='scale(1)'">
        </div>
    </div>

</body>
</html>